  "description": "Vector search extension for SharpCoreDB — SIMD-accelerated similarity search with HNSW + DiskANN-inspired indexing, hybrid fusion, and content-verified immutable artifacts (Munarium-inspired). Native C# 15 / .NET 11 support in v2.1 RC.",
